enhancing the lives of those we serve. Our highly trained and empathetic ca=
regivers offer personalized home care tailored to each client=E2=80=99s uni=
que needs and schedules, empowering them to savor life on their own terms. =
With 23 years of experience working with aging adults, Kimberly brings a we=
alth of knowledge and dedication to her role. She actively contributes to v=
arious organizations.</span></p><p style=3D"margin:0"><span>She served on t=
he Atlanta Regional Commission Advisory Committee on Aging (ARC), the Chero=
